Change-Id: I319e7075abd09fbd5ea987fc09e7fb88f70bbf19
Signed-off-by: Pascal Paillet <p.paillet@st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/optee/optee_os/+/371772
Tested-by: Gatien CHEVALLIER <gatien.chevallier@st.com>
Reviewed-by: Gatien CHEVALLIER <gatien.chevallier@st.com>
Domain-Review: Gatien CHEVALLIER <gatien.chevallier@st.com>
---
 core/lib/scmi-server/conf-optee-stm32mp2.mk | 9 +++++----
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/core/lib/scmi-server/conf-optee-stm32mp2.mk b/core/lib/scmi-server/conf-optee-stm32mp2.mk
index 686702972..371b308e3 100644
